TIP-899 post-quantum signature types (PQScheme, PQAuthSig, pq_auth_sig, pq_scheme).

Upstream tronprotocol/protocol does not carry these yet; they exist only on the
Nile testnet fork. Vendored, additive-only, from:

  repo: https://github.com/tron-nile-testnet/nile-testnet
  tag:  GreatVoyage-Nile-v4.8.2.3-PQ1-build1
  sha:  f58fdd634947038923ff4b04bb609f3a94db2156
  path: protocol/src/main/protos/{core/Tron.proto,api/api.proto}

gen-proto.sh applies this to proto/tron before protoc and restores the
submodule afterwards. Delete this file once upstream merges TIP-899.

